      "value": "This would be a lot harder to give even somewhat close to accurate results. Due to more tools being available in worlds, even huge and complex worlds can perform way better then average ones. There's gazillion of factors involved, the avatar system itself is only a rough estimation, especially that it also counts disabled objects due to not being able to detect everything.",
